cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this catalogue in academic or other work, please cite it as
  below. Note: this repository's own code is Apache-2.0, but the
  catalogue data has mixed provenance and licensing (own curation work is
  CC0-1.0, upstream problem text carries its own source's terms, tool
  metadata is aggregated third-party data) -- see
  https://bact.github.io/opentaig/about/#data for the full breakdown
  before reusing the data specifically, not just citing it.
title: "OpenTAIG"
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of open-source tools mapped to open problems in technical
  AI governance, and linked to the regulations and ethical principles
  they help address.
authors:
  - family-names: "Suriyawongkul"
    given-names: "Arthit"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9698-1899"
url: "https://bact.github.io/opentaig/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bact/opentaig"
license-url: "https://spdx.org/licenses/Apache-2.0"
type: software
keywords:
  - "AI governance"
  - "technical AI governance"
  - "open source"
  - "responsible AI"
  - "AI safety"
